{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/extras/e0d2622503506f1c1bf3ff2b111cae6c.poster.avif?t=1772827996\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/extras/e0d2622503506f1c1bf3ff2b111cae6c.webm?t=1772827996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/extras/e0d2622503506f1c1bf3ff2b111cae6c.mp4?t=1772827996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey with Hoshi, a fallen star determined to ascend back to the heavens. Aurora Heights is a precision platformer that will test your skills as you jump, climb, and dash through intricate and mysterious landscapes where other stars have failed. Unlock new movement abilities, collect keys, discover secrets, and explore a world filled with wonders and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/extras/f0c4262ecc9cb61c6f82d6e27ec6c0d1.poster.avif?t=1772827996\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/extras/f0c4262ecc9cb61c6f82d6e27ec6c0d1.webm?t=1772827996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/extras/f0c4262ecc9cb61c6f82d6e27ec6c0d1.mp4?t=1772827996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend the Challenging Aurora Heights -\u00a0Guide Hoshi through increasingly difficult terrains\u2014 the higher you climb, the tougher it gets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new skills  to reach new heights and hidden areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist Fellow Fallen Stars<strong> </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Meet other stars along your journey. Help them, and they might return the favor, unlocking new paths and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and Collect<strong> -\u00a0</strong>Find keys to unlock new regions and advance further up Aurora Heights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Platforming Experience -\u00a0No combat\u2014focus entirely on exploration and precision platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the Journey, Even in Setbacks -\u00a0Don't fear falling; it might lead you to undiscovered areas and intriguing characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unveil the Mystery - Try to discover why other stars couldn't reach the summit of Aurora Heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3318510?t=1772827996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3318510?t=1772827996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/bdc6916704c52fd236661c69af10e420e3f2924d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772827996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/bdc6916704c52fd236661c69af10e420e3f2924d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772827996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4125540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >