</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new skills  to reach new heights and hidden areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist Fellow Fallen Stars<strong> </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Meet other stars along your journey. Help them, and they might return the favor, unlocking new paths and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and Collect<strong> -\u00a0</strong>Find keys to unlock new regions and advance further up Aurora Heights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Platforming Experience -\u00a0No combat\u2014focus entirely on exploration and precision platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the Journey, Even in Setbacks -\u00a0Don't fear falling; it might lead you to undiscovered areas and intriguing characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unveil the Mystery - Try to discover why other stars couldn't reach the summit of Aurora Heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["heypinds"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318510/acf51b8f4b02a953b48478ba382b8c977d3bcca6/header.jpg?t=1772827996","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3318510/209393937/6fd541b93a6ec60ebdef45b006c1685f59785ecc/1760119824/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760121072","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3318510/209393937/6fd541b93a6ec60ebdef45b006c1685f59785ecc/1760119824/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760121072","highlight":true,"hl